      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُعَامِسٌ</span></b>  A man (TA) <i>who deposits his ordure,</i>
or <i>excrement, at once:</i> (K:) or <i>in a dry,</i> or
<i>tough, state:</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَعْمِسٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

